1
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:41,599
Someone's coming.

2
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:43,280
Excuse me.

3
00:01:43,359 --> 00:01:44,200
We're doing construction work here.

4
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,120
There's live electricity inside. It's dangerous.

5
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:45,719
It's dangerous!

6
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:47,640
Brother Qi.

7
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,359
I've taken all the photos.

8
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,239
Let's go.

9
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,079
It's dangerous!

10
00:01:51,159 --> 00:01:51,719
Hold on.

11
00:01:51,719 --> 00:01:52,439
Just wait a second.

12
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:01,120
There's no time!

13
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,319
Let's go to my place first.

14
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,360
Why is your door open?

15
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,479
And it smells like gas.

16
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,759
What's going on?

17
00:02:51,759 --> 00:02:52,680
This gas tank is worn out.

18
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:53,599
It's been leaking.

19
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:54,599
It could explode.

20
00:02:55,039 --> 00:02:55,520
Hold on!

21
00:02:55,719 --> 00:02:57,280
You need to shut it off first!

22
00:02:59,159 --> 00:02:59,719
There's no time!

23
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:13,560
Let's go.

24
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:16,280
Call Director Hao of the Rehabilitation Hospital,

25
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:18,039
and tell him to go to Lin Kanshan's company

26
00:03:18,039 --> 00:03:18,599
to sign the Computed Tomography scanner

27
00:03:18,599 --> 00:03:19,319
lease contract.

28
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:20,639
Right now.

29
00:03:22,479 --> 00:03:24,039
Can you keep your voice down?

30
00:03:24,039 --> 00:03:25,439
Lina can hear you from inside.

31
00:03:25,599 --> 00:03:26,439
So what if she hears me?

32
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,840
Did I say anything wrong?

33
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,680
She's hanging out with shady people!

34
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,159
Even the school called about it.

35
00:03:31,159 --> 00:03:32,159
How am I supposed to save face?

36
00:03:32,159 --> 00:03:33,919
Don't make it sound so awful.

37
00:03:34,159 --> 00:03:35,199
She's just making friends.

38
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:36,319
Making friends?

39
00:03:36,319 --> 00:03:38,039
With that small-time boss from Taiwan, China, too?

40
00:03:38,199 --> 00:03:39,439
Who doesn't know what she's really after?

41
00:03:39,639 --> 00:03:40,159
Let me tell you,

42
00:03:40,159 --> 00:03:42,159
if anything happens to this niece of yours,

43
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,800
people will say I failed to raise her!

44
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,319
Don't pretend to be the saint here!

45
00:03:45,319 --> 00:03:46,240
If it weren't for you back then,

46
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,800
would she stay away for six months?

47
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:49,280
Would she end up like this today?

48
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,360
She brought that on herself with her loose behavior!

49
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,599
And now it's my fault?

50
00:03:52,599 --> 00:03:53,560
Let me make this clear.

51
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:55,639
If this family is disgraced because of her,

52
00:03:55,639 --> 00:03:56,759
get the hell out of here, all of you!

53
00:03:57,039 --> 00:03:58,639
How can you even say such a thing?!

54
00:03:58,759 --> 00:04:00,159
You're the one who should get out!

55
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,479
Get the hell out!

56
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:03,560
What are you doing?!

57
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:04,319
Get out!

58
00:04:04,639 --> 00:04:05,840
It's endless, day in and day out!

59
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:27,279
We've finished this whole pot of tea,

60
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:28,240
and Xiao Lin still hasn't arrived.

61
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,120
Honestly...

62
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,319
It's fine.

63
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:40,759
The secretary isn't doing his job properly.

64
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,439
So much trash.

65
00:04:50,879 --> 00:04:51,959
I'm late, I'm late!

66
00:04:51,959 --> 00:04:52,920
Why are you only arriving now?

67
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,079
Director Hao has been waiting forever. Hurry.

68
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:55,040
So sorry, my apologies!

69
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:57,079
Mayor Xie suddenly wanted to review some materials.

70
00:04:57,079 --> 00:04:58,199
During his last inspection,

71
00:04:58,199 --> 00:04:59,480
he assigned a research topic on the spot,

72
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,439
and wanted to see it immediately.

73
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:01,879
He only gave me a minute.

74
00:05:01,879 --> 00:05:03,480
Even if I were standing on an active volcano,

75
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,199
I'd still have to jump down and rush right over!

76
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:07,399
Director Hao only has half a minute.

77
00:05:07,959 --> 00:05:08,720
Just kidding.

78
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:10,480
I wouldn't dare give you less time than the mayor.

79
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:12,399
Come, come, come.

80
00:05:12,839 --> 00:05:13,800
As for this contract,

81
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,079
it's been revised back and forth a lot.

82
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:15,720
But I guarantee

83
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:16,959
this is definitely the final version.

84
00:05:16,959 --> 00:05:18,000
Please look it over, leaders.

85
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,079
Here you go, Director Hao.

86
00:05:19,199 --> 00:05:19,839
All right.

87
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,439
Excuse me,

88
00:05:28,279 --> 00:05:30,079
I need to check the old contract.

89
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:31,920
Boss Lin,

90
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,120
I have the old contract right here.

91
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,279
And all the revisions

92
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:35,439
have already been marked on it.

93
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:37,319
How thoughtful.

94
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:41,399
Stamp pad.

95
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:42,279
Fountain pen.

96
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,160
Didn't we already review it a couple days ago?

97
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:54,360
We're all on the same side.

98
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,800
Three companies, three seals.

99
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,519
If there are no major issues,

100
00:05:56,879 --> 00:05:57,560
let's get it stamped right away.

101
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,000
Director Hao still has a meeting to attend.

102
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:01,800
Looks good to me. I'll stamp it now.

103
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,360
Well, in business,

104
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,759
it's always better to be cautious.

105
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:10,759
No problem on my end either.

106
00:06:10,959 --> 00:06:11,480
Brother Xiao.

107
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,920
Thank you so much, Director Hao.

108
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:23,160
Mr. Lin, I hope our partnership this time

109
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,240
will deepen even further going forward.

110
00:06:24,519 --> 00:06:26,160
Next time, I'll definitely introduce you

111
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:26,879
to Director Li next door.

112
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:27,959
That's wonderful, simply wonderful!

113
00:06:27,959 --> 00:06:28,879
Thank you, thank you so much.

114
00:06:28,879 --> 00:06:29,600
I'm off, President Ma.

115
00:06:29,839 --> 00:06:30,759
Thank you for your time, Director Hao.

116
00:06:31,079 --> 00:06:31,680
Take care.

117
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:32,240
All right.

118
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:40,839
Where's Brother Xiao?

119
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:42,920
A lazy donkey always has to pee when duty calls.

120
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,600
He went to take a leak.

121
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,240
Did you settle that matter with Old Ding?

122
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:54,279
That Ding guy...

123
00:06:54,279 --> 00:06:55,839
I'm definitely breaking ties with him this time.

124
00:06:55,839 --> 00:06:57,199
He has gone way too far!

125
00:06:57,199 --> 00:06:58,360
Taking a dump on my head is one thing,

126
00:06:58,360 --> 00:06:59,360
but explosive diarrhea crosses the line!

127
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,360
I'm definitely going after him!

128
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,199
Are you going to help me or not?

129
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,160
Calm down and take your time.

130
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,000
What happened?

131
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,199
I spent my own money

132
00:07:05,199 --> 00:07:06,759
to design and make clothes in Taiwan, China.

133
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:08,360
The workshop had just finished them,

134
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,279
before they even hit the market,

135
00:07:09,399 --> 00:07:10,959
and he bribed workers to rip off my designs!

136
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:11,879
Total piracy and knockoffs!

137
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,600
I'm definitely going to sue him!

138
00:07:14,319 --> 00:07:15,360
If you need to sue, sue him.

139
00:07:15,839 --> 00:07:16,399
Don't worry.

140
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:17,879
The court won't shield someone like that.

141
00:07:17,879 --> 00:07:19,759
Suing him into bankruptcy isn't enough!

142
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:21,000
I'm definitely taking him down this time.

143
00:07:21,759 --> 00:07:23,680
Do either of you know a hitman?

144
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,319
How much would it cost to take one of his legs?

145
00:07:25,319 --> 00:07:26,120
Think I'd qualify?

146
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,120
I could even give you a discount.

147
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,319
Don't be rash.

148
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:30,519
Take him to court if you have to.

149
00:07:30,519 --> 00:07:31,439
Everything can be resolved.

150
00:07:31,439 --> 00:07:32,000
I'm heading out.

151
00:07:32,839 --> 00:07:33,240
Take care.

152
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,279
Let's grab drinks another day!

153
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:56,120
Why did you bring all your things back?

154
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:57,360
Aren't you going back to your aunt's?

155
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,319
My aunt's family went back to Jiangxi.

156
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:00,480
They just got a transfer order.

157
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,920
Have you named this cat yet?

158
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:02,680
What's it called?

159
00:08:03,959 --> 00:08:04,759
Xiao Lin.

160
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:05,759
Xiao Lin.

161
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:07,639
Xiao Lin.

162
00:08:07,639 --> 00:08:08,360
Baby.

163
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,160
Xiao Lin.

164
00:08:10,759 --> 00:08:11,560
Xiao Lin.

165
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,360
Baby Xiao Lin.

166
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:19,360
Call me.

167
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:20,959
Keep it confidential.

168
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:41,519
Search thoroughly.

169
00:08:41,519 --> 00:08:42,480
See if, besides the tickets,

170
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,120
we can find anything else.

171
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:46,679
Why do you think he eats instant noodles every day?

172
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,799
To save time and make big money.

173
00:08:49,559 --> 00:08:50,879
If he weren't doing crooked things,

174
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:51,480
he'd make

175
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:53,480
a diligent, dedicated entrepreneur.

176
00:08:53,679 --> 00:08:55,000
When smart people go bad,

177
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:57,399
they're far more dangerous than fools.

178
00:08:58,559 --> 00:08:59,919
I only realized today

179
00:08:59,919 --> 00:09:01,799
you two are about equally smart.

180
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:03,679
How were you so sure

181
00:09:03,679 --> 00:09:05,480
the gas tank's rubber seal was degraded?

182
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,759
Isn't gas delivery divided into districts?

183
00:09:07,759 --> 00:09:08,519
In our district,

184
00:09:08,519 --> 00:09:10,000
it was contracted to a private company.

185
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:12,120
Almost every household has aging seals.

186
00:09:12,639 --> 00:09:14,480
Jinlan complained many times, all in vain.

187
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:15,279
Until yesterday,

188
00:09:15,279 --> 00:09:17,120
when I called the mayor's hotline.

189
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,200
In another week, I reckon,

190
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,320
they'll all be replaced with new ones.

191
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,000
Getting bold, aren't you?

192
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,120
Taking gambles now.

193
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,440
I didn't have a choice.

194
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:28,120
I just had to bite the bullet and take a gamble.

195
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:28,919
You have no idea—

196
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:30,519
my legs nearly gave out from fear.

197
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:48,240
Just a little alcohol spilled on the outside.

198
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,799
You just blew it with a hair dryer,

199
00:10:49,799 --> 00:10:50,639
and charged me 100 yuan!

200
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:51,519
I didn't even bargain with you.

201
00:10:51,519 --> 00:10:52,840
Didn't I give you the 100 yuan?

202
00:10:52,919 --> 00:10:54,200
So you have to fix it properly!

203
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:54,960
Boss,

204
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,480
your cooling vent is blocked.

205
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,120
Blocked?

206
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,960
What the hell, man?

207
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:00,120
Why didn't you mention it last time?

208
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:00,960
I didn't check it last time.

209
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:01,960
Did you smear something over it?

210
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:03,240
You were in a rush to leave last time!

211
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:03,679
I don't care.

212
00:11:03,679 --> 00:11:04,759
You have to take full responsibility.

213
00:11:04,759 --> 00:11:05,840
I'm not giving you another cent.

214
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:06,679
Just hurry up and fix it.

215
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,279
Fine, fine, I got it.

216
00:11:15,919 --> 00:11:17,480
Brother Xiao, how did it go?

217
00:11:18,639 --> 00:11:19,240
The contract.

218
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:20,759
What contract?

219
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:23,559
Didn't we already go over it face-to-face?

220
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:26,200
Come on, man.

221
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:27,279
It's already been stamped.

222
00:11:27,279 --> 00:11:28,960
Getting it stamped again is a real hassle.

223
00:11:29,519 --> 00:11:30,440
Wait, which clause is it?

224
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:31,879
Tell me about it first.

225
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,000
It's me.

226
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,480
I'm at school right now.

227
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:50,679
What is it?

228
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:51,639
In the past couple of days,

229
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:53,480
have you seen your boss?

230
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,200
My boss?

231
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,559
I saw him yesterday,

232
00:11:58,039 --> 00:11:58,840
and today too.

233
00:11:59,399 --> 00:12:01,639
Did you go back to the base last night?

234
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:02,639
I...

235
00:12:02,639 --> 00:12:03,679
Yes.

236
00:12:03,679 --> 00:12:04,759
Yesterday,

237
00:12:06,039 --> 00:12:09,360
I went back for bedding and clothes,

238
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,639
and then I returned to school.

239
00:12:11,879 --> 00:12:13,120
He... he knows.

240
00:12:13,679 --> 00:12:14,840
He didn't say anything either.

241
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:16,919
Alright.

242
00:12:18,279 --> 00:12:19,720
Keep an eye on him over the next couple of days.

243
00:12:20,039 --> 00:12:21,320
What's wrong with your voice?

244
00:12:21,879 --> 00:12:23,240
Are you sick?

245
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:32,600
Xiazhou,

246
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:34,039
Nanping,

247
00:12:34,759 --> 00:12:35,200
Tong'an.

248
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,639
The three locations of missile units.

249
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:41,080
Has his computer memory card been accessed?

250
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:42,639
When will we be able to see what's on it?

251
00:12:42,919 --> 00:12:44,240
This card is encrypted.

252
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,840
Our technical division can't crack it,

253
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:47,879
so we asked the military tech department.

254
00:12:48,159 --> 00:12:49,360
We just got feedback from them.

255
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:51,399
With our current tech, cracking this card

256
00:12:51,399 --> 00:12:52,559
will take at least 20 years.

257
00:12:52,759 --> 00:12:53,759
20 years?

258
00:12:54,799 --> 00:12:56,000
I'll be retired by then.

259
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:01,360
What do we do then?

260
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,159
If you put it that way,

261
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,240
then all I can say is,

262
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:05,519
we'll just have to wait 20 years.

263
00:13:05,799 --> 00:13:06,639
Unless...

264
00:13:06,799 --> 00:13:08,480
we use the old fallback of luck:

265
00:13:08,799 --> 00:13:09,519
guess the password.

266
00:13:10,799 --> 00:13:12,000
Go back and tell Jinlan

267
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:13,840
we hope that out of all of us,

268
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:14,759
she has the best luck.

269
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,519
Lin Kanshan's young secretary—

270
00:13:16,759 --> 00:13:18,240
is it possible to turn her to our side?

271
00:13:23,799 --> 00:13:24,519
What do you think?

272
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,519
You mean,

273
00:13:28,759 --> 00:13:30,159
we break through to her

274
00:13:30,159 --> 00:13:31,240
and have her find the password?

275
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,159
Or rather,

276
00:13:32,159 --> 00:13:34,039
we focus more of our surveillance

277
00:13:34,039 --> 00:13:34,960
on her?

278
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:37,480
See that?

279
00:13:38,159 --> 00:13:40,320
A strong candidate to succeed you has appeared.

280
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:42,360
Look how accurately he grasps the chief's intent.

281
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,399
Let's prepare both plans.

282
00:13:43,639 --> 00:13:44,600
First, observe her

283
00:13:44,759 --> 00:13:46,519
and see what kind of person

284
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:48,000
this girl deeply in love really is.

285
00:13:49,639 --> 00:13:50,200
Come in.

286
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:54,480
A notice from the Bureau Office:

287
00:13:54,919 --> 00:13:56,639
each division must nominate one candidate,

288
00:13:57,039 --> 00:13:58,720
through internal nomination and a democratic vote,

289
00:13:58,720 --> 00:14:01,120
for the Outstanding Talent Reserve Plan.

290
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,360
So are we nominating or voting?

291
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,840
Isn't it just a formality anyway?

292
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:09,600
It's bound to be He Chunxiao anyway.

293
00:14:15,399 --> 00:14:17,360
Fengge, who do you think we should nominate?

294
00:14:21,639 --> 00:14:22,720
I... I'll get going now.

295
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:45,559
Boss,

296
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:47,720
your cooling vent is blocked.

297
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:48,399
Blocked?

298
00:14:48,399 --> 00:14:50,200
What the hell, man?

299
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,320
Why didn't you mention it last time?

300
00:14:51,399 --> 00:14:52,159
I didn't check it last time.

301
00:14:52,159 --> 00:14:53,279
Did you smear something over it?

302
00:14:53,279 --> 00:14:54,720
You were in a rush to leave last time!

303
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:59,159
I need to check the old contract.

304
00:14:59,519 --> 00:15:00,440
I have the old contract right here.

305
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:02,279
All the revisions have already been marked on it.

306
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:03,519
How thoughtful.

307
00:15:03,639 --> 00:15:04,399
Stamp pad.

308
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:05,159
Fountain pen.

309
00:15:16,919 --> 00:15:18,519
Your cooling vent is blocked.

310
00:15:50,879 --> 00:15:51,559
What are you doing here?

311
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:53,240
Without even calling first?

312
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:54,000
I...

313
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:55,519
I came to drop something off for you.

314
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:57,960
If it's a bad time, never mind.

315
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:00,960
You knocked right in the middle of me peeing.

316
00:16:01,279 --> 00:16:02,399
You tell me if it's a good time.

317
00:16:50,039 --> 00:16:51,480
What's the flowerpot for?

318
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:53,399
My element is fire. I shouldn't keep plants.

319
00:16:54,039 --> 00:16:55,240
These are Nanjing orchids.

320
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:56,399
They're very easy to grow.

321
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:57,279
I saw you had

322
00:16:57,279 --> 00:16:58,720
an empty pot over there.

323
00:16:59,039 --> 00:17:00,240
I also bought you new hangers.

324
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,759
I put them all in your closet.

325
00:17:01,759 --> 00:17:03,600
Do you have any more laundry to wash?

326
00:17:03,600 --> 00:17:04,440
Take it off and give it to me.

327
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,160
I have a washing machine.

328
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,119
Don't bother with that.

329
00:17:06,119 --> 00:17:07,799
Look at these grease spots.

330
00:17:07,799 --> 00:17:09,400
A washing machine can't get those out.

331
00:17:10,240 --> 00:17:11,759
That shirt from last week...

332
00:17:11,759 --> 00:17:13,200
Why haven't I seen it?

333
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:14,160
Where did you put it?

334
00:17:17,279 --> 00:17:18,279
What do you actually want?

335
00:17:20,079 --> 00:17:21,759
Did something happen to Xiaolu again?

336
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:28,200
Don't tell me he really sold my car.

337
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:30,079
He's lost his mind gambling.

338
00:17:30,599 --> 00:17:32,200
I went to see my aunt today.

339
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:34,880
When are we meeting?

340
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:38,440
They're leaving soon. They're about to go.

341
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:40,680
They just received the transfer order.

342
00:17:46,039 --> 00:17:47,480
Didn't I tell you a long time ago?

343
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:48,160
Introduce us.

344
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:49,279
Just let me meet them.

345
00:17:49,519 --> 00:17:50,880
What's the harm in making an introduction?

346
00:17:51,039 --> 00:17:52,279
Great. Now they're leaving.

347
00:17:52,359 --> 00:17:53,599
You can't get anything right.

348
00:17:55,559 --> 00:17:56,839
If not for this,

349
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,759
would you have ever hired me as your secretary?

350
00:17:58,759 --> 00:17:59,759
What do you mean?

351
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:02,119
I was afraid of running into people here.

352
00:18:02,799 --> 00:18:04,519
Did you give Qian Wenying that necklace?

353
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:07,400
Did Qian Wenying live here before?

354
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:11,359
What meds did you take this morning?

355
00:18:11,519 --> 00:18:12,440
The side effects are insane.

356
00:18:16,319 --> 00:18:17,119
What are you doing?

357
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:20,680
What's with you? Acting crazy out of nowhere?

358
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:23,359
I'm sorry, okay?

359
00:18:23,359 --> 00:18:24,039
What's this?

360
00:18:24,640 --> 00:18:25,559
What is this thing?

361
00:18:25,559 --> 00:18:26,960
They're leaving for Jiangxi soon.

362
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,079
They're leaving any minute.

363
00:18:28,359 --> 00:18:29,599
I'm graduating soon, too.

364
00:18:29,599 --> 00:18:31,640
This is the first and last time.

365
00:18:31,839 --> 00:18:32,559
All right, all right, all right.

366
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:33,240
I'm sorry, okay?

367
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:33,680
Let go of me!

368
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:35,079
I'm sorry. Just calm down first.

369
00:18:35,079 --> 00:18:36,039
Just take a seat.

370
00:18:36,839 --> 00:18:37,839
Okay, okay, okay.

371
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:40,440
I'm quitting.

372
00:18:40,599 --> 00:18:41,440
I'm done.

373
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:43,440
Why quit all of a sudden?

374
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:44,039
No reason.

375
00:18:44,039 --> 00:18:44,720
I just want to quit.

376
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:45,720
I'm just not doing this anymore.

377
00:18:46,839 --> 00:18:48,599
Fine, let's part on good terms then.

378
00:18:48,599 --> 00:18:50,279
Come to the office tomorrow to get your pay.

379
00:18:52,519 --> 00:18:53,559
I'll give you your salary.

380
00:18:53,599 --> 00:18:54,680
Don't you want your pay?

381
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,839
You're actually leaving?

382
00:19:19,839 --> 00:19:22,279
If you suddenly find in your home

383
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:24,720
any unusual traces,

384
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:26,400
it is most likely

385
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:28,240
a signal.

386
00:19:28,839 --> 00:19:30,480
You must be on high alert immediately.

387
00:19:31,839 --> 00:19:32,640
But remember,

388
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:35,640
do not disturb the traces in any way.

389
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:38,039
Otherwise, it will put you

390
00:19:38,559 --> 00:19:40,000
and the person signaling you

391
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:41,240
at a serious disadvantage.

392
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:51,559
They're all useless blueprints.

393
00:19:55,079 --> 00:19:56,799
Boss Lin, why is your door open?

394
00:19:56,799 --> 00:19:58,079
And there's a smell of gas.

395
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:00,359
Sit down.

396
00:22:09,839 --> 00:22:10,599
Take off your bag.

397
00:22:17,920 --> 00:22:18,440
Give me your arm.

398
00:22:20,920 --> 00:22:22,000
No need to be nervous.

399
00:22:22,279 --> 00:22:24,559
Everyone must clear the polygraph test.

400
00:22:24,559 --> 00:22:26,359
Fail it, and you go nowhere.

401
00:22:26,559 --> 00:22:28,599
Pass it, and it's smooth sailing.

402
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:37,000
You can think of it as a ritual.

403
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:40,200
A ritual of dedicating yourself to China.

404
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:49,279
Are you ready?

405
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:56,039
When was the first time

406
00:22:56,440 --> 00:22:58,319
you heard your aunt and uncle argue?

407
00:22:58,920 --> 00:23:00,839
Drinking like this every day, how can you become director?

408
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:02,440
Can't you hear me?

409
00:23:03,200 --> 00:23:04,640
Are you done yet?

410
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:05,440
What do you really want?

411
00:23:05,440 --> 00:23:06,039
What are you doing?

412
00:23:06,640 --> 00:23:07,440
Which day, exactly?

413
00:23:09,519 --> 00:23:10,119
What's your problem?

414
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:10,599
You're really doing this?

415
00:23:10,599 --> 00:23:11,319
Try moving again, I dare you.

416
00:23:11,319 --> 00:23:12,079
What are you trying to do?

417
00:23:12,079 --> 00:23:12,960
You're being serious, huh?

418
00:23:13,680 --> 00:23:15,079
I'll repeat the question.

419
00:23:15,279 --> 00:23:16,960
When was the first time

420
00:23:16,960 --> 00:23:19,359
you heard your aunt and uncle fight?

421
00:23:20,039 --> 00:23:21,039
Which day, exactly?

422
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:22,920
It happened too many times.

423
00:23:23,599 --> 00:23:24,400
I don't remember.

424
00:23:28,799 --> 00:23:31,079
Human memory is like this cup of tea.

425
00:23:31,359 --> 00:23:32,799
Sometimes it just gets cold.

426
00:23:32,799 --> 00:23:33,920
Yet it's always there.

427
00:23:34,640 --> 00:23:36,039
Always in your head.

428
00:23:36,519 --> 00:23:37,440
Lina, you're here.

429
00:23:38,559 --> 00:23:39,400
Think carefully.

430
00:23:39,400 --> 00:23:41,039
Come on up. We're almost there.

431
00:23:41,200 --> 00:23:41,920
Look at you.

432
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:42,960
Coming all this way...

433
00:23:43,279 --> 00:23:45,200
Why bring so much fruit?

434
00:23:45,960 --> 00:23:47,519
You can buy all of this here.

435
00:23:47,759 --> 00:23:48,440
It's fine, let me take it.

436
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:49,160
I'll carry it for you.

437
00:23:49,160 --> 00:23:49,920
Come on in.

438
00:23:51,839 --> 00:23:53,200
Your uncle is home.

439
00:23:54,279 --> 00:23:55,240
Lina's here!

440
00:23:55,799 --> 00:23:57,039
Come, say hello.

441
00:23:58,920 --> 00:23:59,799
Hello, Uncle.

442
00:24:01,119 --> 00:24:02,079
Ah, Lina is here.

443
00:24:02,559 --> 00:24:03,759
Look at her, coming all this way...

444
00:24:03,759 --> 00:24:05,440
and bringing us so much fruit.

445
00:24:05,759 --> 00:24:06,920
This room inside...

446
00:24:06,920 --> 00:24:08,319
was prepared specially for you.

447
00:24:09,359 --> 00:24:09,839
Lina.

448
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:11,000
Change your shoes first.

449
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:14,559
Right.

450
00:24:14,599 --> 00:24:17,440
Take this luggage inside too.

451
00:24:20,119 --> 00:24:21,680
From now on, you'll live here.

452
00:24:22,720 --> 00:24:23,880
This is your room.

453
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:24,920
Thank you, Auntie.

454
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:26,240
A week?

455
00:24:27,200 --> 00:24:28,759
Or a month?

456
00:24:29,039 --> 00:24:30,559
Why were they arguing?

457
00:24:32,160 --> 00:24:33,200
Was it because of you?

458
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:06,599
Lina!

459
00:25:07,359 --> 00:25:07,960
Lina!

460
00:25:08,799 --> 00:25:09,480
What are you doing?

461
00:25:09,480 --> 00:25:11,640
Uncle! Uncle! Uncle!

462
00:25:15,640 --> 00:25:17,440
Uncle! Uncle!

463
00:25:17,440 --> 00:25:18,279
What the hell are you doing?!

464
00:25:20,240 --> 00:25:21,319
You animal!

465
00:25:21,319 --> 00:25:22,799
How could you do such a thing?!

466
00:25:23,079 --> 00:25:24,319
You animal!

467
00:25:24,480 --> 00:25:26,480
You dare hit me, you bitch?!

468
00:25:26,839 --> 00:25:28,079
Damn right I do!

469
00:25:28,079 --> 00:25:29,880
I'll hit you! I'll hit you!

470
00:25:30,079 --> 00:25:31,519
You're not even human!

471
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:36,759
I...

472
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:38,599
I should never have come here.

473
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:40,880
I should never have stayed at his place.

474
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:46,759
Back then...

475
00:25:46,759 --> 00:25:48,759
I really didn't know what to do.

476
00:25:53,799 --> 00:25:56,319
I must take him to court.

477
00:26:08,960 --> 00:26:09,599
I'm sorry.

478
00:26:11,119 --> 00:26:13,599
Asking you to spy on your own family

479
00:26:15,079 --> 00:26:16,440
is indeed an ethical dilemma.

480
00:26:17,519 --> 00:26:18,240
I'm sorry.

481
00:26:19,160 --> 00:26:20,440
But the one who hurt you

482
00:26:20,799 --> 00:26:22,240
doesn't deserve to be your family.

483
00:26:22,240 --> 00:26:23,599
He doesn't even deserve to be human.

484
00:26:27,720 --> 00:26:28,680
What's wrong?

485
00:26:29,480 --> 00:26:30,000
I'm fine.

486
00:26:30,079 --> 00:26:30,720
I'm fine.

487
00:26:41,720 --> 00:26:42,240
All right.

488
00:26:42,880 --> 00:26:45,359
Let's talk about Lin Kanshan.

489
00:26:47,119 --> 00:26:50,319
What kind of person do you think he is?

490
00:27:00,119 --> 00:27:01,319
Excuse me, sir.

491
00:27:01,680 --> 00:27:02,960
What time does this counter close?

492
00:27:02,960 --> 00:27:03,759
Why isn't anyone here?

493
00:27:04,759 --> 00:27:06,839
Maybe he had business and left early.

494
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:11,279
Sir, here.

495
00:27:11,680 --> 00:27:12,079
All right.

496
00:27:12,079 --> 00:27:12,680
Have a smoke.

497
00:27:12,680 --> 00:27:13,279
Thanks.

498
00:27:15,119 --> 00:27:16,720
Has he always done repairs here?

499
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:18,279
He comes by every few days.

500
00:27:18,519 --> 00:27:19,519
I've seen him.

501
00:27:19,519 --> 00:27:20,559
For how long? Do you remember?

502
00:27:21,400 --> 00:27:23,079
People change here all the time.

503
00:27:23,200 --> 00:27:24,319
I can't quite remember.

504
00:27:25,240 --> 00:27:25,839
Thank you.

505
00:27:26,279 --> 00:27:26,839
You're welcome.

506
00:27:35,519 --> 00:27:36,319
He's very hardworking.

507
00:27:36,839 --> 00:27:38,400
As long as it's to make money,

508
00:27:38,880 --> 00:27:39,960
he can skip meals,

509
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:41,440
or even go without sleep.

510
00:27:42,000 --> 00:27:43,720
But he'd only do that for himself.

511
00:27:44,160 --> 00:27:45,079
He never easily

512
00:27:45,079 --> 00:27:46,839
opens his heart to anyone.

513
00:27:47,359 --> 00:27:48,720
He's very guarded.

514
00:27:49,079 --> 00:27:50,720
He always thinks people want to cheat him.

515
00:27:54,119 --> 00:27:54,720
What else?

516
00:27:56,400 --> 00:27:57,440
Yet sometimes,

517
00:27:58,839 --> 00:27:59,960
he can be very vulnerable.

518
00:28:01,880 --> 00:28:03,079
He's actually quite endearing.

519
00:28:04,359 --> 00:28:05,079
Do you...

520
00:28:06,240 --> 00:28:07,240
Do you love him?

521
00:28:20,440 --> 00:28:21,319
I love him,

522
00:28:24,920 --> 00:28:26,240
but he doesn't love me.

523
00:28:45,559 --> 00:28:46,400
What's wrong?

524
00:28:51,279 --> 00:28:51,920
My medicine...

525
00:28:54,119 --> 00:28:54,920
My medicine...

526
00:28:57,480 --> 00:28:58,160
What's wrong?

527
00:28:59,839 --> 00:29:00,359
Medicine...

528
00:29:00,599 --> 00:29:01,200
Where is it?

529
00:29:19,720 --> 00:29:20,720
Medicine kit.

530
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:22,720
Here, here!

531
00:29:28,200 --> 00:29:28,960
Hurry!

532
00:29:35,599 --> 00:29:36,440
That's it.

533
00:29:36,759 --> 00:29:37,759
Give it to me, quick!

534
00:29:38,720 --> 00:29:39,200
Hurry!

535
00:29:40,319 --> 00:29:41,200
Give it to me!

536
00:29:41,759 --> 00:29:42,200
Quick!

537
00:29:43,319 --> 00:29:43,880
Hurry!

538
00:29:44,279 --> 00:29:45,160
Give it to me!

539
00:29:45,759 --> 00:29:46,319
Quick!

540
00:30:02,240 --> 00:30:03,119
A light sleeper,

541
00:30:04,799 --> 00:30:06,640
sleeping only two hours a night.

542
00:30:07,640 --> 00:30:09,720
Years of irregular meals,

543
00:30:11,400 --> 00:30:15,119
ulcers ate right through his stomach.

544
00:30:15,960 --> 00:30:17,480
When it got unbearable,

545
00:30:19,359 --> 00:30:20,599
this was the only relief.

546
00:30:25,359 --> 00:30:26,519
Is this Shenzhou Strait Travel Agency?

547
00:30:26,799 --> 00:30:28,480
I booked a tour with you a while back.

548
00:30:29,200 --> 00:30:30,759
Zhuhai, and Hong Kong, China.

549
00:30:31,319 --> 00:30:32,200
I lost something.

550
00:30:32,680 --> 00:30:33,799
I want to try and find it.

551
00:30:35,279 --> 00:30:36,640
I'd like to check who the guide was.

552
00:30:37,119 --> 00:30:38,480
I can reach out to him myself.

553
00:30:40,279 --> 00:30:40,960
Right.

554
00:30:42,279 --> 00:30:43,279
Is the name Jinlan?

555
00:30:44,359 --> 00:30:45,079
"Jin" as in "jinxiu,"

556
00:30:45,279 --> 00:30:46,720
"lan" as in "lanhua," right?

557
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:49,680
Thank you.

558
00:30:51,279 --> 00:30:52,839
May I ask your name?

559
00:30:53,160 --> 00:30:53,759
Jinlan.

560
00:30:59,599 --> 00:31:00,359
Remember,

561
00:31:00,359 --> 00:31:01,519
under no circumstances

562
00:31:01,839 --> 00:31:04,279
should you do anything at all costs.

563
00:31:04,720 --> 00:31:05,799
Go safe and sound,

564
00:31:06,079 --> 00:31:07,119
and come back safe and sound.

565
00:31:22,759 --> 00:31:23,319
Hello.

566
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:24,400
Airport, please.

567
00:31:24,839 --> 00:31:25,400
Hurry, hurry!

568
00:31:25,559 --> 00:31:25,759
Alright.

569
00:31:27,039 --> 00:31:27,599
In a rush, huh?

570
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:42,720
Throw away your plane ticket.

571
00:31:42,960 --> 00:31:44,119
Exit through Gate Two of the airport,

572
00:31:44,319 --> 00:31:45,200
and look for a

573
00:31:45,200 --> 00:31:48,079
gray sedan with plates ending in 6266.

574
00:31:48,079 --> 00:31:49,119
Get right in.

575
00:31:49,119 --> 00:31:51,079
Someone will drive you to Xiamen

576
00:31:51,079 --> 00:31:52,799
to take a boat back to Taipei.

577
00:31:53,960 --> 00:31:55,599
The moment there's any risk of exposure,

578
00:31:55,839 --> 00:31:56,720
come right back.

579
00:31:57,359 --> 00:31:58,759
Whenever you need it,

580
00:31:58,759 --> 00:32:00,200
someone right nearby

581
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:02,200
will tell you what to do.

582
00:32:19,079 --> 00:32:20,079
Originating location:

583
00:32:23,839 --> 00:32:24,400
Section Chief Wei,

584
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:26,000
someone just called Lin Kanshan.

585
00:32:26,000 --> 00:32:27,240
The call was traced to

586
00:32:27,240 --> 00:32:28,440
the Pacific Nightclub.

587
00:32:28,759 --> 00:32:29,839
It's likely an emergency contact.

588
00:32:32,400 --> 00:32:34,079
Brother Qi, leadership hasn't given orders yet.

589
00:32:34,079 --> 00:32:35,359
Should we hold off before heading out?

590
00:32:35,599 --> 00:32:36,839
Notify dispatch and the duty office now.

591
00:32:36,839 --> 00:32:37,920
Keep them in the loop.

592
00:32:37,920 --> 00:32:38,519
Hurry up.

593
00:32:38,720 --> 00:32:40,400
Have Baoshan and Wu Jiali drive as well.

594
00:32:40,599 --> 00:32:41,079
Remember,

595
00:32:41,319 --> 00:32:42,559
don't leak a word to anyone.

596
00:32:42,559 --> 00:32:43,640
Including everyone else in the division.

597
00:32:49,440 --> 00:32:50,640
Old Wei hasn't called yet.

598
00:32:50,640 --> 00:32:52,480
Are bureau leaders still deliberating?

599
00:32:52,480 --> 00:32:53,480
Lin Kanshan is going to run.

600
00:32:53,480 --> 00:32:54,880
Any leader would take immediate follow-up action.

601
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:55,559
Hurry!

602
00:33:00,839 --> 00:33:01,720
Find Jin Lina first.

603
00:33:02,160 --> 00:33:03,319
Lin Kanshan has already left the country.

604
00:33:39,119 --> 00:33:39,759
Jin Lina.

605
00:33:41,960 --> 00:33:43,039
And you are?

606
00:33:43,200 --> 00:33:44,480
Municipal State Security Bureau.

607
00:33:44,480 --> 00:33:45,000
We'd like to talk.

608
00:34:06,200 --> 00:34:06,880
Sir.

609
00:34:08,599 --> 00:34:09,239
Sir.

610
00:34:09,400 --> 00:34:10,239
Take a look.

611
00:34:16,480 --> 00:34:17,559
It's all the latest.

612
00:34:30,960 --> 00:34:33,199
Many newspapers brought back from Matsu Island

613
00:34:33,719 --> 00:34:34,920
go to the press first,

614
00:34:35,159 --> 00:34:37,079
and only then reach our desks.

615
00:34:37,320 --> 00:34:38,559
Many people make money off this,

616
00:34:38,559 --> 00:34:39,800
yet the higher-ups do nothing about it.

617
00:34:39,920 --> 00:34:42,639
Regarding mainland intel gathering,

618
00:34:42,920 --> 00:34:44,960
we can't just rely on existing methods.

619
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:46,719
The problem right now is that

620
00:34:47,519 --> 00:34:49,119
amateurs are leading professionals.

621
00:34:50,039 --> 00:34:51,559
Oh, so you're the expert here.

622
00:34:52,800 --> 00:34:54,199
Then how do you think we should handle it?

623
00:34:56,280 --> 00:34:57,400
Using mainlanders against the mainland,

624
00:34:57,719 --> 00:34:59,079
and seeing it through to the end!

625
00:34:59,719 --> 00:35:02,920
Those fishermen trading intel at sea,

626
00:35:03,079 --> 00:35:04,880
and the students visiting as tourists...

627
00:35:05,039 --> 00:35:06,559
Who knows how many assets we could actually use?

628
00:35:07,199 --> 00:35:09,039
You can never finish off the Communists.

629
00:35:09,239 --> 00:35:11,039
The issue right now is...

630
00:35:11,719 --> 00:35:13,400
Tell me that after you become director.

631
00:35:13,400 --> 00:35:14,079
All right.

632
00:35:14,400 --> 00:35:15,719
If you have real business, spill it.

633
00:35:18,800 --> 00:35:20,719
The intelligence we just obtained,

634
00:35:20,719 --> 00:35:22,239
in less than 24 hours,

635
00:35:22,239 --> 00:35:24,400
was sitting on the Communists' desks.

636
00:35:25,079 --> 00:35:27,039
Like Cao Liaoping in Hong Kong, China,

637
00:35:27,039 --> 00:35:28,639
which Lin Kanshan can corroborate.

638
00:35:28,960 --> 00:35:31,440
It all proves we have a mole in our ranks.

639
00:35:32,119 --> 00:35:32,760
And then?

640
00:35:32,960 --> 00:35:34,199
Everyone must be vetted.

641
00:35:34,440 --> 00:35:35,880
Starting with myself.

642
00:35:36,519 --> 00:35:37,440
I propose

643
00:35:37,440 --> 00:35:39,519
we wiretap everyone

644
00:35:39,519 --> 00:35:40,519
with mid-level intelligence clearance.

645
00:35:41,880 --> 00:35:43,239
That includes me, then.

646
00:35:48,320 --> 00:35:49,519
If it's really you,

647
00:35:49,679 --> 00:35:50,440
I'll just accept my fate.

648
00:35:50,800 --> 00:35:51,320
Seriously.

649
00:35:51,559 --> 00:35:53,719
I'd definitely want you as my Party sponsor.

650
00:35:54,039 --> 00:35:55,719
I'd even join mainland State Security!

651
00:35:57,760 --> 00:35:59,440
If you've got evidence,

652
00:35:59,440 --> 00:36:00,639
bring it out.

653
00:36:00,639 --> 00:36:02,119
If you produce it right now,

654
00:36:02,400 --> 00:36:04,079
I'll have him shot by noon.

655
00:36:08,440 --> 00:36:09,320
Besides,

656
00:36:09,840 --> 00:36:10,559
on your end,

657
00:36:10,840 --> 00:36:11,519
with that "mountain,"

658
00:36:12,039 --> 00:36:13,239
is his polygraph test done yet?

659
00:36:16,199 --> 00:36:17,320
Over the past week,

660
00:36:17,320 --> 00:36:18,559
have you experienced insomnia,

661
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:20,719
frequent dreams, waking up early,

662
00:36:20,920 --> 00:36:22,320
or difficulty falling asleep?

663
00:36:22,960 --> 00:36:23,519
Yes.

664
00:36:24,280 --> 00:36:26,400
Did you use sleep aids in the mainland?

665
00:36:27,880 --> 00:36:28,320
Yes.

666
00:36:29,159 --> 00:36:30,440
The side effects of these medications

667
00:36:30,519 --> 00:36:31,840
include memory loss.

668
00:36:31,840 --> 00:36:33,599
Have you noticed this in yourself?

669
00:36:34,239 --> 00:36:34,679
No.

670
00:36:36,159 --> 00:36:37,599
Have you ever been drunk?

671
00:36:37,840 --> 00:36:38,280
How many times?

672
00:36:40,760 --> 00:36:41,400
Yes.

673
00:36:41,920 --> 00:36:42,599
Once.

674
00:36:42,960 --> 00:36:43,760
Be specific.

675
00:36:45,280 --> 00:36:46,800
There's a kind of plum wine in the mainland.

676
00:36:47,000 --> 00:36:48,159
Drinking the wine is fine,

677
00:36:48,360 --> 00:36:50,559
but eating the plums makes you drunk fast.

678
00:36:50,880 --> 00:36:52,119
After getting drunk,

679
00:36:52,480 --> 00:36:53,679
did you sleep with your secretary?

680
00:36:54,800 --> 00:36:55,280
No.

681
00:37:02,599 --> 00:37:03,280
Are you sure?

682
00:37:09,639 --> 00:37:11,079
I was drunk.

683
00:37:11,079 --> 00:37:12,559
I can't be 100 percent sure.

684
00:37:14,559 --> 00:37:15,400
Do you like her?

685
00:37:16,199 --> 00:37:16,760
No.

686
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:22,400
This is an urgent matter.

687
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:24,400
We hope you will cooperate with us

688
00:37:24,559 --> 00:37:26,320
and tell us

689
00:37:26,440 --> 00:37:27,320
everything you know.

690
00:37:34,840 --> 00:37:37,159
Staying silent and keeping your mouth shut

691
00:37:37,360 --> 00:37:38,760
is, in this room,

692
00:37:38,760 --> 00:37:39,719
the most foolish,

693
00:37:39,760 --> 00:37:40,519
the most childish,

694
00:37:40,519 --> 00:37:42,039
and the most senseless thing you can do.

695
00:37:42,199 --> 00:37:44,039
Every second you waste

696
00:37:44,039 --> 00:37:46,239
will come back to punish you doubly.

697
00:37:47,159 --> 00:37:49,320
I'm trying to save you right now.

698
00:37:49,800 --> 00:37:51,400
Silence, lies, zoning out—

699
00:37:51,480 --> 00:37:52,679
all of it is non-compliance,

700
00:37:52,679 --> 00:37:54,079
sheer obstinacy that will inevitably

701
00:37:54,079 --> 00:37:54,960
drag you into the abyss.

702
00:37:55,400 --> 00:37:57,400
Do you even know what you're doing?

703
00:38:02,519 --> 00:38:03,719
We really mean no harm.

704
00:38:03,719 --> 00:38:04,960
Don't be so afraid.

705
00:38:05,000 --> 00:38:06,320
I hope you fully understand

706
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:07,920
that we're trying to help you right now.

707
00:38:14,360 --> 00:38:16,400
You're Lu Zhifei's girlfriend,

708
00:38:16,880 --> 00:38:19,480
yet you got involved with Lin Kanshan.

709
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:21,679
What kind of behavior is that?

710
00:38:21,679 --> 00:38:22,199
No...

711
00:38:23,079 --> 00:38:24,079
Xiao Lu and I...

712
00:38:25,159 --> 00:38:25,920
Lin Kanshan...

713
00:38:26,039 --> 00:38:27,559
Lin Kanshan doesn't even have a wife.

714
00:38:27,599 --> 00:38:29,760
He just doesn't have a wife here.

715
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:31,639
Sure he doesn't have one in Taiwan, China?

716
00:38:34,400 --> 00:38:35,079
We...

717
00:38:35,559 --> 00:38:37,679
You think he'll marry you and protect you?

718
00:38:38,119 --> 00:38:40,320
Those are just fairy tales to fool children.

719
00:38:40,320 --> 00:38:41,440
How could you be so...

720
00:38:43,599 --> 00:38:45,800
Why did he hire you as his secretary?

721
00:38:51,000 --> 00:38:53,119
"Know which business makes the most money?"

722
00:38:53,840 --> 00:38:54,719
"Military property."

723
00:38:55,599 --> 00:38:57,480
"Introduce me to your aunt,"

724
00:38:57,480 --> 00:38:58,719
"we can make a fortune together."

725
00:38:59,320 --> 00:39:01,199
"Your aunt is an officer in the military, right?"

726
00:39:01,440 --> 00:39:02,400
"What is she in charge of?"

727
00:39:03,480 --> 00:39:05,559
"Let's treat them to a meal sometime."

728
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:06,639
"Have a meal,"

729
00:39:06,639 --> 00:39:08,360
"and the chief will feel more at ease."

730
00:39:08,679 --> 00:39:10,039
"Haven't I told you long ago?"

731
00:39:10,119 --> 00:39:10,920
"Make an introduction."

732
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:11,920
"Get to know each other."

733
00:39:12,199 --> 00:39:13,519
"What's the harm in getting acquainted?"

734
00:39:13,679 --> 00:39:15,039
Well, now he's about to leave,

735
00:39:15,559 --> 00:39:16,800
and you couldn't get a single thing done.

736
00:39:19,079 --> 00:39:20,039
Everything you've been

737
00:39:20,400 --> 00:39:21,840
second-guessing in your head,

738
00:39:22,320 --> 00:39:23,920
you must confess every last detail.

739
00:39:25,559 --> 00:39:26,239
Where is he?

740
00:39:26,719 --> 00:39:28,639
Where do you think he'd be right now?

741
00:39:28,719 --> 00:39:29,559
I don't know.

742
00:39:29,840 --> 00:39:30,639
Where is he right now?

743
00:39:30,639 --> 00:39:31,679
I really don't know.

744
00:39:31,679 --> 00:39:32,360
Where could he be?

745
00:39:32,360 --> 00:39:33,400
I really don't know!

746
00:39:34,719 --> 00:39:35,719
You don't know today,

747
00:39:36,480 --> 00:39:37,320
but maybe tomorrow,

748
00:39:37,920 --> 00:39:39,119
you'll have a chance to find out.

749
00:39:39,599 --> 00:39:40,679
Cooperate with us.

750
00:39:40,920 --> 00:39:42,079
That is the only thing

751
00:39:42,880 --> 00:39:44,239
you can do right now.

752
00:39:46,440 --> 00:39:46,960
I...

753
00:39:52,039 --> 00:39:52,679
I...

754
00:39:56,159 --> 00:39:56,840
What's wrong?

755
00:39:59,159 --> 00:40:00,880
My heart...

756
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:02,280
My heart feels terrible.

757
00:40:02,920 --> 00:40:04,320
I can't catch my breath.

758
00:40:04,320 --> 00:40:05,039
Relax.

759
00:40:05,360 --> 00:40:06,719
Slow down, slow down, take it easy.

760
00:40:07,159 --> 00:40:08,000
As of right now,

761
00:40:08,239 --> 00:40:09,440
the ECG looks completely normal.

762
00:40:09,840 --> 00:40:11,079
Are you feeling discomfort anywhere else?

763
00:40:11,239 --> 00:40:12,400
My heart is still fluttering.

764
00:40:12,639 --> 00:40:13,760
It just won't settle down.

765
00:40:13,760 --> 00:40:14,960
Let's keep you under observation a bit longer.

766
00:40:15,119 --> 00:40:16,440
If you feel unwell later on,

767
00:40:16,719 --> 00:40:17,559
come back anytime.

768
00:40:21,159 --> 00:40:23,280
Remember everything I told you.

769
00:40:23,480 --> 00:40:24,960
Not a single detail can be missed.

770
00:40:27,559 --> 00:40:28,400
Repeat it back to me.

771
00:40:32,239 --> 00:40:34,920
Clean Lin Kanshan's house regularly.

772
00:40:35,400 --> 00:40:37,320
Notify you the moment he comes back.

773
00:40:37,760 --> 00:40:38,960
Keep an eye on Wen Zongshu.

774
00:40:39,159 --> 00:40:41,039
Regularly report on his situation.

775
00:40:44,320 --> 00:40:44,920
What else?

776
00:40:46,679 --> 00:40:49,280
The first of every month at 12:30 PM.

777
00:40:49,400 --> 00:40:51,079
Fixed time, fixed location.

778
00:40:51,360 --> 00:40:52,199
Meet and report.

779
00:41:03,079 --> 00:41:04,480
Making it look so real.

780
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:07,239
Does this junk really work that well?

781
00:41:07,239 --> 00:41:08,599
Watch your language, please.

782
00:41:09,239 --> 00:41:10,400
This is state-of-the-art equipment.

783
00:41:10,679 --> 00:41:11,480
There's no way it doesn't work.

784
00:41:20,400 --> 00:41:21,880
You two step outside for a moment.

785
00:41:22,159 --> 00:41:22,880
And close the door.

786
00:41:22,880 --> 00:41:23,480
Yes, sir.

787
00:41:32,239 --> 00:41:33,559
The chief is gracious enough.

788
00:41:33,760 --> 00:41:35,000
He heard you were back,

789
00:41:35,000 --> 00:41:35,800
so he came specially to see you.

790
00:41:39,079 --> 00:41:39,639
Have a seat.

791
00:41:43,920 --> 00:41:44,599
Please, sit down.

792
00:41:52,480 --> 00:41:53,519
I've heard

793
00:41:53,800 --> 00:41:57,119
you're very close with mainland officials.

794
00:41:57,519 --> 00:41:58,400
Just how close?

795
00:41:59,639 --> 00:42:00,519
Tell it like it is.

796
00:42:02,400 --> 00:42:04,000
Following Section Chief Zhu's orders,

797
00:42:04,000 --> 00:42:05,480
my main focus in Minzhong was

798
00:42:05,599 --> 00:42:06,559
befriending high-level figures.

799
00:42:06,559 --> 00:42:07,480
Party, government, military, and business,

800
00:42:07,679 --> 00:42:08,599
I have plenty of brothers.

801
00:42:10,639 --> 00:42:11,840
Xie Fengshi...

802
00:42:12,719 --> 00:42:13,639
Is he your brother too?

803
00:42:14,960 --> 00:42:16,320
I daren't say that about Vice Mayor Xie,

804
00:42:16,320 --> 00:42:17,960
but his trusted subordinate,

805
00:42:17,960 --> 00:42:19,039
named Wu Jinhe,

806
00:42:19,039 --> 00:42:20,159
is his right-hand man.

807
00:42:20,639 --> 00:42:22,199
I'm exceptionally close with him.

808
00:42:23,519 --> 00:42:26,280
I heard everyone in his faction is up for promotion.

809
00:42:27,039 --> 00:42:28,239
"Exceptionally close," huh?

810
00:42:28,960 --> 00:42:31,920
I don't have a clear grasp of that phrase.

811
00:42:32,599 --> 00:42:35,519
Meaning you served in the army together?

812
00:42:36,840 --> 00:42:37,679
Well, did you?

813
00:42:38,119 --> 00:42:38,679
Yes.

814
00:42:39,199 --> 00:42:40,480
This isn't a polygraph test.

815
00:42:40,480 --> 00:42:41,360
No need to be nervous.

816
00:42:42,079 --> 00:42:45,039
I just dropped by on a whim for a chat.

817
00:42:51,840 --> 00:42:53,840
What about the mainland's State Security?

818
00:42:54,679 --> 00:42:55,880
Have you had any contact with them?

819
00:43:08,320 --> 00:43:09,159
I'm Oho Ou,

820
00:43:09,159 --> 00:43:10,760
inviting you to watch the drama series

821
00:43:10,760 --> 00:43:11,599
*Confrontation*.

822
00:43:12,440 --> 00:43:13,599
I heard...

823
00:43:13,599 --> 00:43:15,400
Is Old Zhu in poor health?

824
00:43:15,400 --> 00:43:16,360
He fainted twice.

825
00:43:16,360 --> 00:43:17,320
Is he about to retire?

826
00:43:17,320 --> 00:43:19,480
Boss Lin will definitely come back.

827
00:43:19,480 --> 00:43:20,320
If I were him,

828
00:43:20,320 --> 00:43:21,159
I'd come back too.

829
00:43:21,159 --> 00:43:21,800
I...

830
00:43:21,800 --> 00:43:22,480
Let's have a round of applause!

831
00:43:22,480 --> 00:43:23,800
This young talent selection

832
00:43:23,800 --> 00:43:24,880
isn't fair at all.

833
00:43:24,880 --> 00:43:25,920
If you don't recommend He Chunxiao,

834
00:43:25,920 --> 00:43:27,000
no one will accept it.

835
00:43:27,000 --> 00:43:28,880
Your son is in prison.

836
00:43:28,880 --> 00:43:31,199
If you want to see him, you must eat properly

837
00:43:31,199 --> 00:43:32,280
and stay alive.

838
00:43:33,840 --> 00:43:35,679
Hey old classmate, it's Li Fengge.

839
00:43:35,679 --> 00:43:37,440
I'm calling about the sentence reduction.
